APPCH:010,I,I32L,,ZZMIS,ZZ,P,C,E A ,,,IF,,,,,,,,,,,+,07000,,,,,,,,,,,,,,;
APPCH:020,I,I32L,,ZZFAF,ZZ,P,C,E F ,,,CF,,IZZC,ZZ,P,I,,3247,0138,3247,0138,J,05500,05500,,,,-343,,,,,,,,,;
